.RE
.TP
.B qargi send
Send a task to an idle cloud session.
.PP
The text is the whole brief: TASK, DONE (a command whose exit status decides it), BASE, SCOPE and so on. The session is titled <instance>\-<label>; use the same slug for the agent/<slug> branch.
.RS
.nf
qargi send NAME TASK
.fi
.RE
.RS
