.PP
Run it in the background. The line is QARGI WATCH <sid> idle|terminated|budget_reached|budget_tight|timeout|auth|error. budget_tight ends it early, with the cost and the ceiling in cents, so you can raise the ceiling (qargi instances budget NAME CENTS \-\-session SID) and watch again.
.RS
.nf
qargi watch SID [MAX_SECONDS]
.fi
.RE
